:{"commit_sha":"2eb8d6ef9fd29e80f0f4710880ca27e850306595","position":"1785841811540154001-29a33836-ae0c-40eb-bf27-0514a57223d9"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"A6-0a merged 019e32e03d and closed with certified plan/completion attestations. A6-0b plan remediated to avoid any reset when local-only commits may exist; signed PASS, claimed. Oracle design recorded on ticket: strong-tier real-Git shell tests, existing reconverge reuse, moving-ref contention case, standard-tier implementer with edge/E2E held out.","timestamp":1785831454651109001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"A6-0b RED: 9/9 new focused tests fail for intended missing behavior. Happy path = clean pre-epoch clone does not adopt rewritten epoch tip. Held-out = same-epoch union, local-only/missing/corrupt/existing-epoch/fetch-failure refusal matrix, moving-ref pin, and ensure-script-only autodeploy selection. No production edits. Preparing standard-tier worker with only support + happy test visible; held-out matrix/autodeploy tests stay outside worker tree.","timestamp":1785831717083957001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"A6-0b resumed after pause. Standard-tier implementer attempt 1 passed the visible happy path and existing focused tests. Full held-out oracle: 7/9 green; two behavioral gaps found (fetch-failure warning did not explicitly say deferred/unavailable, and pinned-adoption race did not preserve a concurrently advanced tracking ref). Re-dispatched the same standard-tier implementer with only the missing observable contracts; held-out test paths remain absent from its worktree. Oracle Ruff/format gate is now clean.","timestamp":1785832010805269001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"A6-0b held-out validation complete. Standard-tier implementer attempt 2 fixed the fetch-failure warning; the remaining race failure was an oracle fixture defect (the injected tracking-ref target object was absent locally). Under revert-first discipline, disabled adoption, fixed the fixture to prefetch that object, reconfirmed RED, restored code, and confirmed GREEN. Added omitted AC coverage: table-driven equal/behind/ahead shell cases (2 pass/1 behind RED with reconverge removed, then 3/3 GREEN), local-diverged and corrupt-local refusal cases, generated-entrypoint execution with PAT unset, and post-vote artifact-write failure preservation. Focused behavioral suite: 20 passed. Defect-seeded adoption mutation went RED; tests assert observable Git refs/tips, warnings, vote receipt, and process results and survive behavior-preserving refactors.","timestamp":1785832480723219001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"A6-0b implementation complete at commit 93a40f7 (standard-tier worker attempts: 4). Local four-pass review round 1 found a destructive under-lock epoch fall-through; added deterministic RED races, fixed with an inner else, and expanded HEAD/dirty/rebase/reset-failure coverage. Round 2 found unexpected convergence failures aborted run_ensures under set -e; added a RED interpreter-failure test and wrapped the convergence heredoc best-effort. Final focused oracle: 26 passed; make lint, make typecheck, shell syntax, verify-commit-ticket, and final make test all pass. Final local review PASS with two accepted advisories: hardcoded origin/tickets is the ticket's explicit load-bearing review-bot clone contract, while sync.reconverge remains authoritative for compatible configured stores; LockTimeout has shared lock-suite coverage and the new RebaseGuard case exercises this script's exception/preserve path. Ready for Gerrit push.","timestamp":1785840078222194001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"A6-0b live bootstrap complete: merged SHA 93a40f7 deployed as image sha256:a267497a57ccafb8b9db65fbbcb6dd25c76cf8dca483237d5f5ab82bf5725514; health ok/in_flight 0; persistent clone converged 5e522cad -> 5c0430de equal to origin/tickets with no merge/rebase/stash; deployed-runtime disposable E1/E2 probe refused as designed. Full receipts are on ticket 62ec. Two pre-existing untracked event JSONs in the persistent clone require residual-gap disposition.","timestamp":1785841811540154001}],"created_at":1785831451120089001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[],"description":"","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"a8e8-e91d-35a3-4cfd","ticket_type":"session_log","title":"Session log","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["9e834aa5-a45a-4924-abf9-3d5b5c0426c1","eb0f6e9a-b3f9-451b-918f-7d785768dd89","5631b15b-510d-4ecc-ac52-8fabff3f8a0b","ef1cb871-9aaa-4fa6-8a08-0e4e6f75cb29","fedda83e-afb3-48d9-b054-f8675a2e2a3c","99e5ad0a-bad1-4604-acc8-6f7f4f3029e1","29a33836-ae0c-40eb-bf27-0514a57223d9"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786659648077910001,"uuid":"fd614203-c59d-4337-8dbc-c44ff1931811"}